[36m(TaskRunner pid=213532)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=213532)[0m So, 2^a*3^b*7^c ≡1 mod10.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=213532)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=213532)[0m But in our table, the only such case is when a=0, b=1, c=1.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=213532)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=213532)[0m Because 2^0*3^1*7^1=1*3*7=21≡1 mod10.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=213532)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=213532)[0m Yes.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=213532)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=213532)[0m Thus, sum is 21.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=213532)[0m 
