[36m(TaskRunner pid=213532)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=213532)[0m 2. **Prime factorization of \(9!\)**:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=213532)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=213532)[0m    9! = 2^7 \times 3^4 \times 5 \times 7
[36m(TaskRunner pid=213532)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=213532)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=213532)[0m 3. **Identify divisors with units digit 1**:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=213532)[0m    - The divisors must not be divisible by 5.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=213532)[0m    - The units digit being 1 implies the number must be congruent to 1 modulo 10.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=213532)[0m    - The divisors must be composed of the prime factors 2, 3, and 7.
