[36m(TaskRunner pid=213532)[0m 4. **Check possible combinations**:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=213532)[0m    - The divisors are \(2^a \times 3^b \times 7^c\) where \(0 \leq a \leq 7\), \(0 \leq b \leq 4\), and \(0 \leq c \leq 1\).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=213532)[0m    - We need \(2^a \times 3^b \times 7^c \equiv 1 \pmod{10}\).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=213532)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=213532)[0m 5. **Possible solutions**:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=213532)[0m    - For \(c = 0\): \(2^a \times 3^b \equiv 1 \pmod{10}\)
