[36m(TaskRunner pid=213532)[0m      - \(a = 0, b = 1\) gives \(d = 21\)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=213532)[0m    - For \(c = 2\): \(2^a \times 3^b \times 49 \equiv 1 \pmod{10}\)
